<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mdclass:FunctionalOption xmlns:mdclass="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/metadata/mdclass" uuid="66cc79b0-6ed3-4919-b75e-d930e5004c7d">
  <name>UseCashAndBankAccountsOfLinesOfBusinessOnSeparateAccountsAndCashAccounts</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Use cash and bank accounts of lines of business on separate accounts and cash accounts</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>استفاده از حساب‌های نقد و بانکی خطوط کسب‌وکار در حساب‌ها و صندوق‌های جداگانه</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Utilizzare la contabilità del flusso di cassa per i singoli conti e le casse</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Używaj ewidencji środków pieniężnych kierunków działalności na oddzielnych rachunkach i kasach</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Использовать учет денежных средств направлений деятельности на отдельных счетах и кассах</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Ayrı hesaplarda ve kasalarda iş kolunun kasa ve banka hesapları kullan</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Sử dụng tài khoản tiền mặt đối với mảng hoạt động trên các tài khoản và quỹ tiền mặt riêng biệt</value>
  </synonym>
  <comment>Directions of activity are indicated directly on the Bank accounts and cash registers themselves</comment>
